---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-steel/40 bg-void-2">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
		<div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
			<div>
				<p class="font-display text-xl uppercase tracking-tight text-chalk">The Foundry Barbell Club</p>
				<p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-chalk-dim">
					A strength training gym built into a 1920s iron foundry in Lawrenceville, Pittsburgh.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-chalk-dim">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-chalk-dim">Visit</p>
				<p>4417 Butler St</p>
				<p>Pittsburgh, PA 15201</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="tel:+14125550147" class="hover:text-green">(412) 555-0147</a>
				</p>
				<p><a href="mailto:train@foundrybarbell.com" class="hover:text-green">train@foundrybarbell.com</a></p>
			</div>

			<div class="font-mono text-sm text-chalk-dim">
				<p class="mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-chalk-dim">Hours</p>
				<p>Mon&ndash;Fri &nbsp; 6a&ndash;8p staffed</p>
				<p>Sat&ndash;Sun &nbsp; 8a&ndash;2p staffed</p>
				<p>24/7 fob access &middot; members</p>
				<p class="mt-3">
					<a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-green"
						>@foundrybarbellclub</a
					>
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="flight-ticks my-8"></div>

		<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-chalk-dim/70 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
			<p>&copy; {year} The Foundry Barbell Club</p>
			<p>Concept site by Noel Ngerem &middot; not a real business</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
